    print("understates risk for a concentrated book like this one -- 10 real named countries")
    print("plus Ukraine/Zimbabwe/Belarus, several individually >4% of EAD. The Monte Carlo")
    print("simulation captures that name-concentration effect directly, which is why it")
    print("typically shows meaningfully higher Economic Capital.")
    print("=" * 78 + "\n")


